    "updated_at": "2026-08-06T02:34:10Z",
    "body": "I am getting a lot of web shader compilation stutter, even after doing the suggested instancing of shaders/particles for a frame in advance of gameplay.  The shader cache runs, the game freezes for a bit while they load (okay, normal) and then I still get a lag whenever the shader is first seen in game.  The stutter is a lot less than if I hadn't made the cache, but it's still there and negatively affects the gameplay.",
